00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:22.700
<v Mike>Yeah, no, I know. It's the, the, the, the boss fights are the standout moment of this game because they, it's, believe it or not, even the very first boss fight gives you a gun.

00:08:22.940 --> 00:08:24.600
<v Mike>It's like, holy shit. They have those.

00:08:24.920 --> 00:08:26.380
<v Sean>They manifest a gun.

