<v Mike>Like shouldn't we be saving these for Faust?

00:08:37.360 --> 00:08:39.660
<v Sean>And now Faust is the guy that took, okay.

00:08:39.760 --> 00:08:41.720
<v Sean>He's, he's the one that wants there to be an impeachment.

00:08:42.460 --> 00:08:46.580
<v Mike>Yes. Yeah. Or just resign, you know, let the vice president run things for a little bit.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:47.900
<v Mike>Maybe the vice president's compromised.

00:08:48.100 --> 00:08:49.620
<v Mike>Maybe the vice president is Faust.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:50.960
<v Mike>Maybe that's his. Whoa.

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:58.720
<v Mike>So the president calls in Paul and Vince, the Akari warriors, as they're known, uh, to infiltrate the enemy hideout.

00:08:58.740 --> 00:09:00.000
<v Mike>Find the dealers.

00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:03.180
<v Sean>Um, and, uh, that's a 21 jump street reference.

00:09:03.180 --> 00:09:04.100
<v Sean>Find the dealers.

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:05.840
<v Sean>Infiltrate the supply. Right.

00:09:06.760 --> 00:09:28.520
<v Mike>Uh, and you know, I, I think like in, in terms of what we got here as a game, that story might be the most interesting part because we could talk about like the levels and shit, but like at the end of the day, it is just a, a fisticuffs of top down scrolling combat.

00:09:28.520 --> 00:09:43.460
<v Mike>Uh, over and over again, where you just walk into enemy groups, try to punch and kick eventually just jump kick to clear enough space, grab pickups as they appear, use your limited weapons carefully, and just keep pushing forward.

00:09:43.460 --> 00:09:49.640
<v Mike>The name of the game is just to keep pushing forward because they're just going to continue to throw enemies at you until you get to these bosses.

00:09:49.640 --> 00:09:56.800
<v Mike>bosses. And sometimes even the bosses are like, you just run up to them and you just keep punching them in the face too.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:09:58.100
<v Mike>And they get kind of like stunned.

00:09:59.100 --> 00:10:04.080
<v Mike>It's a weird, it's just a weird way to like build to the trilogy.

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:08.700
<v Mike>And we saw with double dragon three that they couldn't necessarily land it either.

00:10:08.700 --> 00:10:12.440
<v Mike>And they did like this weird thing where they regressed from the second one.

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:17.440
<v Mike>I don't even know if this one's like regressing so much as it's just like, it hasn't, it hasn't interest.

