00:10:29.400 --> 00:10:39.860
<v Mike>And it's just like, how many, like, I don't, I don't know that it's not, there's not a lot to talk about here in the way that I want to talk about a podcast where I don't just like break down the elements of a game.

00:10:39.860 --> 00:10:43.380
<v Mike>But I talk about what's interesting, I'm running out of interesting things.

00:10:43.520 --> 00:10:44.760
<v Mike>Sure. At the 10 minute mark.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:51.000
<v Sean>Well, I mean, what I'm going to, I'm just going to give a little bit of my two cents here as to what it seems that they're doing.

00:10:51.640 --> 00:10:59.840
<v Sean>And like, at least it is interesting that the Ikari guys have been playing around with the genre a bit.

00:10:59.920 --> 00:11:06.300
<v Sean>Like it's almost like they've been keeping the same like mode of play.

00:11:06.300 --> 00:11:10.680
<v Sean>Like every time it's top down, it's mostly going to be vertical scroll.

00:11:11.060 --> 00:11:17.880
<v Sean>But in a second game, they kind of add like RPG mechanics or at least action RPG mechanics.

00:11:19.420 --> 00:11:25.800
